    <string name="flow_info_why_body">Psychological research shows entering flow state typically requires a 15-20 minute warm-up. Optimal flow duration is 60-90 minutes, closely matching the human ultradian rhythm.</string>
    <string name="flow_info_strategy_title">Suggested Strategy</string>
    <string name="flow_info_strategy_body">• Set 90-minute distraction-free blocks&#10;• Allow yourself 20 minutes to warm up&#10;• Once in flow, follow it naturally&#10;• Stop and rest when mentally scattered</string>
    <string name="flow_info_daily_limit">Daily deep work is recommended at 3-4 hours max; exceeding this sharply reduces output quality.</string>
